# Testing & Quality Standards

No test framework is configured yet. Until tests are added, follow these manual quality standards for every feature.

## Required UI States

Every data-driven feature must implement:

### Loading
```tsx
{isLoading && (
  <div className="flex items-center justify-center py-8">
    <Loader2 className="h-8 w-8 animate-spin text-primary" />
    <p className="text-sm text-muted-foreground">Đang tải...</p>
  </div>
)}
```

### Error
```tsx
{error && (
  <div className="rounded-lg border border-destructive/40 bg-destructive/10 p-4">
    <p>{error.message}</p>
    <Button onClick={retry}>Thử lại</Button>
  </div>
)}
```

### Empty
```tsx
{items.length === 0 && (
  <div className="border border-dashed py-10 text-center">
    <p>Chưa có dữ liệu</p>
    <Button>Ghi nhật ký đầu tiên</Button>
  </div>
)}
```

### Success
- Toast notification: `toast.success("Đã lưu!")`
- Navigate or update UI to reflect new state

## Responsive Layout

- Test at 375px (mobile), 768px (tablet), 1024px+ (desktop)
- Use responsive grids: `grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3`
- Prevent horizontal scroll: `overflow-x-hidden`, `min-w-0`, `truncate`
- Sidebar collapses to icons on small screens

## Accessibility

- Use semantic HTML (`main`, `header`, `nav`, `button`)
- Form fields have associated `Label` components
- Buttons have visible text (not icon-only without tooltip)
- Color is not the only indicator (pair with icons/text)
- Focus states handled by shadcn/ui defaults

## Form Validation

- Validate before submit
- Show field-level errors in Vietnamese
- Disable submit button during loading
- Required fields clearly marked

